# IoT Sentinel — Mosquitto ACL (Least Privilege)

user temp01
topic write iot/telemetry/temperature/TEMP-001

user hum01
topic write iot/telemetry/humidity/HUM-001

user motion01
topic write iot/telemetry/motion/MOTION-001

user door01
topic write iot/telemetry/door/DOOR-001
topic write iot/command/DOOR-001

user camera01
topic write iot/telemetry/camera/CAM-001
topic write iot/command/CAM-001

user light01
topic write iot/telemetry/light/LIGHT-001
topic write iot/command/LIGHT-001

user nodered
topic read iot/telemetry/#
topic write iot/security/events
topic write iot/security/alerts
topic write iot/security/incidents

topic deny #